  "query_preview": "..\nA much drier regime has moved in over the Marianas this afternoon. \nHowever, the monsoon pattern still supports the development of \nscattered showers across the region later this evening near midnight.\nLatest model guidance indicates a drier pattern than previously \nexpected. This has resulted in decreased POPs (Probability of \nPrecipitation) over the next several days. Periods of locally heavy \nshowers, along with gusty winds in heavier showers, remain a \npossibility through Sunday, though it does now look less likely.",
